* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* Member       RMVTWAIT
* Version      1.3.5
* Function     Return default wait time for Ping to VTAM Printer
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* jwo 97-07-09 P(163367) use dynamic wait time for 'ping'
* ----------------------------- Parameter ------------------------------
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
01 #WAIT-PING                   (P4)
END-DEFINE
*
#WAIT-PING := 100    /* Default value if not specified in printer attr.
END
